#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:13
msgid ""
"**LaTeX not installed**: `which pdflatex` -- install texlive-full or "
"mactex."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "**Missing package**: Add to preamble:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:22
msgid "VGroup TypeError"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:24
msgid ""
"**Error:** `TypeError: Only values of type VMobject can be added as "
"submobjects of VGroup`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:26
msgid ""
"**Cause:** `Text()` objects are `Mobject`, not `VMobject`. Mixing `Text` "
"with shapes in a `VGroup` fails on Manim CE v0.20+."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:42
msgid ""
"**Rule:** If the group contains any `Text()`, use `Group`. If it's all "
"shapes or all `MathTex`, `VGroup` is fine."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:44
msgid ""
"**FadeOut everything:** Always use `Group(*self.mobjects)`, not "
"`VGroup(*self.mobjects)`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:49
msgid "Group save_state() / restore() Not Supported"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:51
msgid "**Error:** `NotImplementedError: Please override in a child class.`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:53
msgid ""
"**Cause:** `Group.save_state()` and `Group.restore()` are not implemented"
" in Manim CE v0.20+. Only `VGroup` and individual `Mobject` subclasses "
"support save/restore."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:69
msgid "letter_spacing Is Not a Valid Parameter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:71
msgid ""
"**Error:** `TypeError: Mobject.__init__() got an unexpected keyword "
"argument 'letter_spacing'`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_troubleshooting.md:73
msgid ""
"**Cause:** `Text()` does not accept `letter_spacing`. Manim uses Pango "
"for text rendering and does not expose kerning controls on `Text()`."
msgstr ""

